This product includes or references data and services from the following organizations:

1. Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications (総務省自治行政局)
   - Dataset: 全国地方公共団体コード (都道府県コード及び市区町村コード, 令和6年1月1日更新)
   - Source URL: https://www.soumu.go.jp/main_content/000925835.xlsx
   - Terms Notice: Users should consult the Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications' own terms of use on their official website.
   - Attribution: 本製品の全国地方公共団体マスターデータは、総務省「都道府県コード及び市区町村コード」を加工・構造化して作成したものです。
   - Reproducibility: Bundled municipalities.json is reproducible from the bundled soumu_000925835.xlsx via src/jaden/data/build_municipalities.py (pinned SHA256 in src/jaden/data/provenance.json).

2. Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (国土地理院)
   - Service: 地名検索API (GSI Address Search API)
   - Endpoint: https://msearch.gsi.go.jp/address-search/AddressSearch
   - Attribution: 出典：国土地理院 (地名検索API)。座標系は世界測地系 JGD2011 (WGS 84 準拠互換, EPSG:6668 / EPSG:4326) に準拠します。
   - Terms & Rate Notice: Users should consult the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan's (GSI) own terms of use on their official website. For automated or high-volume queries, users must maintain reasonable request intervals to prevent server burden.

3. Japan Post (日本郵便) and Prefecture Mapping
   - Bundled Files: src/jaden/data/county_mapping.json and src/jaden/data/jis_prefectures.json
   - Provenance Notice: The provenance of county_mapping.json and jis_prefectures.json is not reproducible from this repository; no raw source file or rebuild script is included in the repository. Users requiring independent verification should consult official government sources or Japan Post directly.
